  "releaseNotes": "* Updated Polyfill version from 9.18.0 to 10.3.0\n* Updated DotExtensions version from 10.0.0 Alpha 6 to 10.2.1\n* Fixed Polyfill showing as a public dependency\n* Updated DotExtensions.Memory version from 10.0.0 Alpha 6 to 10.2.1\n- Fixed `ImmediateMemoryCountAtMostExtensions` implementation\n- Fixed `ImmediateMemoryExcludeExtensions` implementation\n- Fixed `DeferredMemoryWhereExtensions` implementation\n- Safeguarded `ImmediateMemoryGetRangeExtensions` methods against invalid indexes\n- Removed inappropriate `ArgumentException` throw usage in `ImmediateMemorySelectManyExtensions` and `ImmediateMemoryGetRangeExtensions`\n- Fixed XML documentation comments in `ImmediateMemoryFirstAndLastExtensions`\n- Improved helpfulness of argument exception messages in `ImmediateMemoryFirstAndLastExtensions`",
